343
15:37.320 --> 15:38.440
None of your business!

344
15:38.440 --> 15:40.240
You're the ones delaying me!

345
15:41.200 --> 15:41.870
Dr. Che.

346
15:41.910 --> 15:42.200
Dad...

347
15:42.200 --> 15:44.270
-You have to believe in science... -What's going on?

348
15:44.270 --> 15:46.390
-I do believe in science... -It's a bit complicated.

349
15:46.390 --> 15:46.960
After the consultation,

350
15:46.960 --> 15:47.630
I'll tell you.

351
15:47.630 --> 15:49.790
These mediocre Western doctors

352
15:49.960 --> 15:51.720
can only treat minor ailments,

353
15:52.390 --> 15:53.520
