360
16:03.360 --> 16:04.320
a lot of sense.

361
16:04.440 --> 16:05.270
Exactly.

362
16:05.480 --> 16:07.550
You just mentioned Western medicine.

363
16:07.550 --> 16:09.440
It indeed has its limitations.

364
16:10.080 --> 16:11.200
It's not like Chinese medicine.

365
16:11.200 --> 16:13.440
Chinese medicine is very profound.

366
16:14.510 --> 16:15.390
Sir, I just

367
16:15.390 --> 16:16.870
heard you talking about

368
16:16.870 --> 16:17.790
Yin-Yang Bagua.

369
16:17.790 --> 16:19.510
You're quite an expert.

370
16:19.630 --> 16:20.360
I...

371
16:19.740 --> 16:29.380
[Yellow Zone]

372
16:20.360 --> 16:21.910
I have also done

373
16:21.960 --> 16:23.790
quite a bit of research on Chinese medicine.

374
16:23.790 --> 16:25.120
Look at this.

375
16:25.120 --> 16:25.960
Please...

376
16:26.630 --> 16:28.360
