377
16:29.530 --> 16:31.460
[Quiet]

378
16:31.600 --> 16:32.880
[Night sweats] [Bad breath]

379
16:32.950 --> 16:35.270
[Ears ringing and ears deaf] [Purpura] [Coughing]

380
16:36.360 --> 16:37.750
I didn't expect

381
16:38.510 --> 16:39.790
this scam hospital

382
16:39.790 --> 16:41.650
to have a capable person like you.

383
16:42.000 --> 16:42.860
I'm flattered.

384
16:42.960 --> 16:44.360
Daughter, we're not going anywhere.

385
16:44.360 --> 16:46.020
We'll get treated right here.

386
16:51.390 --> 16:52.670
The patient's symptoms present as

387
16:52.670 --> 16:54.390
intermittent epileptic seizures.

388
16:54.390 --> 16:55.510
The brain CT shows

389
16:55.510 --> 16:57.480
a low-density lesion in the left frontal lobe,

390
16:57.480 --> 17:00.480
accompanied by brain tissue edema around the lesion.

391
17:01.360 --> 17:03.220
Lumbar puncture pressure is 260.

392
17:04.270 --> 17:05.720
The EEG indicates

393
17:06.270 --> 17:08.440
abnormal discharge around the lesion area.

394
17:08.440 --> 17:09.440
It suggests vascular lesions

395
17:09.440 --> 17:10.680
or tumor lesions.

396
17:14.000 --> 17:14.640
The head CT angiography

397
17:14.640 --> 17:16.569
shows no vascular abnormalities.

398
17:17.270 --> 17:19.510
The head MRI findings

399
17:19.510 --> 17:21.589
also don't quite match the

400
17:21.589 --> 17:23.550
typical characteristics of an intracranial tumor.

401
17:23.550 --> 17:24.920
Has the lumbar puncture cerebrospinal fluid test

402
17:24.920 --> 17:25.750
been done?

403
17:26.069 --> 17:26.880
Yes.

404
17:27.000 --> 17:28.000
Elevated white blood cells.

405
17:28.000 --> 17:29.310
There is indeed inflammation,

406
17:29.310 --> 17:31.040
but no bacteria were cultured.

407
17:31.440 --> 17:33.700
What about antibiotics? Were they used?

408
17:33.830 --> 17:34.640
Yes,

409
17:34.720 --> 17:36.380
but the effect is not obvious.

410
17:40.240 --> 17:41.680
That's strange.

411
17:42.030 --> 17:42.830
Our hospital's

412
17:42.830 --> 17:45.090
examination methods are still limited.

413
17:45.110 --> 17:46.310
Don't delay his treatment.

414
17:46.310 --> 17:48.970
Hurry up and have him transferred immediately.

415
17:51.000 --> 17:52.550
I thought so too before.

416
17:52.720 --> 17:53.510
But

417
17:53.920 --> 17:55.440
given the patient's condition,

418
17:55.440 --> 17:56.570
once he leaves here,

419
17:56.720 --> 17:57.160
he probably won't

420
17:57.160 --> 17:58.550
go to another hospital.

421
18:00.110 --> 18:01.750
This is the patient's own choice.

422
18:01.750 --> 18:02.750
There's nothing we can do.

423
18:02.750 --> 18:03.590
Doctor!

424
18:03.920 --> 18:05.510
Doctor!

425
18:07.000 --> 18:07.790
Doctor!

426
18:18.310 --> 18:19.160
Almost there.

427
18:19.160 --> 18:20.200
I'm already inside.

428
18:20.200 --> 18:21.750
I heard Zhang Jiao woke up.

429
18:21.750 --> 18:22.480
Where else could I be?

430
18:22.480 --> 18:23.280
Use your head.

431
18:23.830 --> 18:25.630
Xiaoximen Hospital, of course.

432
18:27.110 --> 18:28.310
You three wait for me.

433
18:28.310 --> 18:29.680
Jiao actually woke up?

434
18:29.680 --> 18:32.280
Yeah, I've never seen anything like it either.

435
18:38.680 --> 18:39.480
Jiao.

436
18:40.750 --> 18:41.480
Zhang Jiao.

437
18:41.480 --> 18:42.750
Are you Zhang Jiao?

438
18:44.830 --> 18:46.490
Open your mouth and let me see.

439
18:47.030 --> 18:48.200
Open your mouth.

440
19:07.720 --> 19:10.400
Lift this hand. Let me see.

441
19:11.270 --> 19:12.130
Lift your hand.

442
19:17.960 --> 19:19.200
Lift this hand.

443
19:49.110 --> 19:51.310
Jiao's language function is impaired.

444
19:51.480 --> 19:53.590
Her brain was deprived of blood and oxygen for a long time,

445
19:53.590 --> 19:55.590
so her cognitive function is also impaired.

446
19:55.590 --> 19:56.720
It may

447
19:57.070 --> 19:58.750
take a few months to recover.

448
19:59.590 --> 20:01.200
But you don't need to worry.

449
20:01.720 --> 20:03.450
Fortunately, she has woken up.

450
20:04.720 --> 20:05.510
Okay.

451
20:06.640 --> 20:08.960
Jiaojiao.

452
20:10.030 --> 20:10.830
Dr. Liu.

453
20:11.480 --> 20:12.790
Words cannot express our gratitude!

454
20:12.790 --> 20:13.590
Thank you.

455
20:16.110 --> 20:16.750
Thank you!

456
20:19.030 --> 20:20.000
Thank you!

457
20:20.240 --> 20:21.030
Thank you!

458
20:21.030 --> 20:21.550
Congratulations.

459
20:21.550 --> 20:22.440
Thank you!

460
20:22.590 --> 20:24.390
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

461
20:24.750 --> 20:25.350
Thank you!

462
20:26.350 --> 20:27.000
Thank you!

463
20:27.440 --> 20:28.240
Thank you! Thank you!

464
20:28.240 --> 20:29.000
Thank you!

465
20:29.920 --> 20:30.830
Thank you!

466
20:31.830 --> 20:32.880
I don't know how to express it!

467
20:32.880 --> 20:34.240
If there's any heavy work in the hospital in the future,

468
20:34.240 --> 20:34.720
leave it to me!

469
20:34.720 --> 20:36.310
Just find me. I won't charge a penny!

470
20:36.310 --> 20:37.550
I'll do it for free.

471
20:37.750 --> 20:38.480
Thank you!

472
20:38.480 --> 20:39.640
Thank you!

473
20:40.400 --> 20:41.350
Look at me.

474
20:41.350 --> 20:42.920
It's such a happy occasion.

475
20:43.030 --> 20:44.440
Why am I crying?

476
20:45.960 --> 20:47.270
Yeah, you shouldn't cry.

477
20:47.270 --> 20:48.600
Shouldn't you be happy?

478
20:49.550 --> 20:50.350
Well,

479
20:50.750 --> 20:52.440
Zhang Jiao's strong will

480
20:52.440 --> 20:53.350
and the perseverance

481
20:53.350 --> 20:55.590
you two have shown

482
20:56.240 --> 20:57.830
have really touched us.

483
20:58.000 --> 20:59.510
Let's give them a round of applause too!

484
20:59.510 --> 20:59.960
Let's clap!

485
20:59.960 --> 21:00.240
Great!

486
21:00.240 --> 21:00.510
Come on.

487
21:00.510 --> 21:01.200
Great!

488
21:01.640 --> 21:03.480
Come on! Come on! Come on!

489
21:03.480 --> 21:05.200
Kid, you are amazing.

490
21:05.440 --> 21:06.570
You are a superhero.

491
21:30.830 --> 21:31.920
Zhang Jiao woke up.

492
21:32.640 --> 21:34.500
It should have been a happy thing.

493
21:34.920 --> 21:36.590
But I just can't be happy.

494
21:37.350 --> 21:38.720
Because I know

495
21:39.480 --> 21:40.680
