498
22:07.110 --> 22:08.070
You're here.

499
22:09.240 --> 22:10.880
This... This is Mr. Cao.

500
22:11.350 --> 22:12.790
And this is Mrs. Cao.

501
22:13.790 --> 22:14.830
They are all

502
22:14.960 --> 22:16.230
