503
22:17.640 --> 22:20.240
working with me.

504
22:21.550 --> 22:23.310
You can discuss it first.

505
22:24.200 --> 22:25.000
I...

506
22:26.000 --> 22:27.160
If you have any requests,

507
22:27.160 --> 22:29.790
just tell me anytime,

508
22:29.790 --> 22:30.550
