519
22:51.640 --> 22:52.510
I know.

520
22:52.880 --> 22:54.200
But we just feel

521
22:55.830 --> 22:57.440
terribly sorry for our baby.

522
22:59.030 --> 23:00.160
If we were

523
23:00.160 --> 23:01.680
non-disabled parents,

524
23:02.720 --> 23:03.830
this accident might never have

525
23:03.830 --> 23:05.030
happened to our baby.

526
23:06.400 --> 23:08.270
We didn't take good enough care of our baby.

527
23:08.270 --> 23:16.070
I'd like to give our baby a formal funeral.

528
23:17.030 --> 23:17.920
Is that okay?

529
23:17.920 --> 23:18.590
Got it.

530
23:22.590 --> 23:24.350
So we want to give this baby

531
23:26.240 --> 23:28.160
a more formal funeral.

532
23:32.070 --> 23:32.960
Is that okay?

533
23:36.400 --> 23:37.200
Dad.

534
23:38.070 --> 23:38.880
Let's do that.

535
23:43.510 --> 23:44.310
Sure.

536
23:46.550 --> 23:47.880
I'll arrange it for you.

537
23:49.550 --> 23:50.350
Well...

538
23:51.200 --> 23:53.790
I won't charge you for it.

539
23:55.400 --> 23:56.160
Thank you.

540
23:57.510 --> 23:58.400
Thank you.

541
24:02.350 --> 24:05.470
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

542
24:05.890 --> 24:09.060
