556
25:01.440 --> 25:03.810
♪ The wind in the city ♪

557
25:04.190 --> 25:06.940
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

558
25:07.740 --> 25:10.470
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

