26:01.300 --> 26:06.310
♪ We come to each other ♪

572
26:38.200 --> 26:39.330
Zhang Jiao is awake.

573
26:43.070 --> 26:45.530
Then we can use this to promote the hospital.

574
26:46.440 --> 26:47.350
Why are you always thinking about

575
26:47.350 --> 26:48.750
