576
26:48.750 --> 26:49.920
Then ask Zhang

577
26:50.070 --> 26:51.870
if he's willing to let me use him.

578
26:52.790 --> 26:53.920
We can't have paid

579
26:54.480 --> 26:55.940
40% of the fee for nothing.

580
26:57.000 --> 26:58.110
How noble of you.

581
26:58.790 --> 27:00.050
You didn't spend a cent

582
27:00.310 --> 27:02.000
and all the credit goes to you.

583
27:03.240 --> 27:04.350
And now you're standing here

584
27:04.350 --> 27:05.240
to lecture me.

585
27:08.240 --> 27:10.900
Do you think I don't know what you're getting at?

586
27:11.110 --> 27:12.710
Don't you just want to tell me

587
27:14.720 --> 27:15.640
