588
27:15.640 --> 27:16.270
Right?

589
27:16.270 --> 27:16.920
Yes.

590
27:31.240 --> 27:32.000
Is there any chance you'll change your mind?

591
27:32.000 --> 27:32.720
No.

592
27:46.960 --> 27:49.110
If you want to leave, no one can stop you.

593
27:49.110 --> 27:50.910
Come see me tomorrow afternoon.

594
27:51.400 --> 27:53.200
I'll process your resignation.

595
27:53.240 --> 27:53.960
Okay.

596
27:59.790 --> 28:00.550
Thank you.

597
28:01.960 --> 28:03.480
Thank you for your help

598
28:03.790 --> 28:05.190
over the past few months.

599
28:17.580 --> 28:22.770
[President's Office]

600
28:36.350 --> 28:37.200
Secretary Lu,

601
28:37.400 --> 28:38.960
notify President Liu and Chief Physician Tong

602
28:38.960 --> 28:40.000
to come to my office for a meeting.

603
28:40.000 --> 28:40.790
Also,

604
28:41.160 --> 28:42.590
bring in the administration office's

605
28:42.590 --> 28:43.920
best problem-solvers,

606
28:44.030 --> 28:46.230
I want to hold a brainstorming session.

607
28:46.730 --> 28:47.760
I think

608
28:48.070 --> 28:49.720
we should go by the contract.

609
28:50.440 --> 28:51.440
Isn't he poor?

610
28:51.750 --> 28:53.070
Fine. He can leave.

611
28:53.070 --> 28:54.800
But he has to pay compensation.

612
28:54.960 --> 28:55.920
That won't work.

613
28:56.680 --> 28:57.720
I've already tried that.

614
28:57.720 --> 28:58.440
And I promised him

615
28:58.440 --> 28:59.160
I wouldn't use it again.

616
28:59.160 --> 28:59.550
President.

617
28:59.550 --> 29:01.440
Which matters more to you, keeping him or saving face?

618
29:01.440 --> 29:02.160
Keeping him, of course.

619
29:02.160 --> 29:02.920
What's the point of saving face?

620
29:02.920 --> 29:03.920
Can I have both?

621
29:03.920 --> 29:05.440
If tough tactics don't work, try a softer approach.

622
29:05.440 --> 29:06.880
Just give him an apartment.

623
29:06.880 --> 29:09.110
The apartments near our hospital...

624
29:10.070 --> 29:11.480
they cost over 1,000 yuan per square meter, right?

625
29:11.480 --> 29:12.550
A two-bedroom place

626
29:12.550 --> 29:14.480
would cost over 100,000 yuan, right?

627
29:14.480 --> 29:15.440
That much money wouldn't

628
29:15.440 --> 29:16.750
even buy you one square meter in Shenzhen.

629
29:16.750 --> 29:17.790
He wouldn't even care.

630
29:17.790 --> 29:18.720
Then what do we do?

631
29:18.720 --> 29:19.590
If neither approach works,

632
29:19.590 --> 29:20.310
