636
29:25.680 --> 29:27.340
he'd build a real bond with us.

637
29:27.350 --> 29:28.000
But...

638
29:28.000 --> 29:28.440
this guy...

639
29:28.440 --> 29:29.880
seems like he's missing a screw.

640
29:29.880 --> 29:30.550
I mean...

641
29:30.550 --> 29:31.750
Trying to appeal to him emotionally

642
29:31.750 --> 29:34.920
is a total waste of time.

643
29:35.720 --> 29:36.590
Not necessarily.

644
29:36.590 --> 29:37.880
When it comes to social conventions,

645
29:37.880 --> 29:39.000
some people just don't understand them,

646
29:39.000 --> 29:40.550
while others simply don't want to.

647
29:40.550 --> 29:41.030
So tell me,

648
29:41.030 --> 29:42.160
which kind do you think

649
29:42.160 --> 29:43.240
a smart guy like Liu Zhengliang is?

650
29:43.240 --> 29:44.300
The stubborn kind.

651
29:45.480 --> 29:46.270
I think

652
29:46.270 --> 29:47.510
we should try appealing to his feelings.

653
29:47.510 --> 29:48.960
No, that won't work.

654
29:48.960 --> 29:49.640
-He has no feelings. -Well,

655
29:49.640 --> 29:51.310
I don't mean our relationship with him.

656
29:51.310 --> 29:53.030
I'm saying we should set him up with a woman

657
29:53.030 --> 29:53.880
and get him to fall in love.

658
29:53.880 --> 29:54.920
If he gets married, he'll stay.

659
29:54.920 --> 29:56.440
-How do you know... -Hey, listen.

660
29:56.440 --> 29:57.680
Seriously, he's a professional doctor.

661
29:57.680 --> 29:58.550
If we're talking about skills,

662
29:58.550 --> 29:59.920
we need to weigh our options.

663
29:59.920 --> 30:01.440
Does our hospital

664
30:01.440 --> 30:02.160
need a skilled doctor,

665
30:02.160 --> 30:02.960
or someone

666
30:02.960 --> 30:04.240
as loyal as I am?

667
30:04.790 --> 30:06.110
Between loyalty and ability,

668
30:06.110 --> 30:07.480
which is more valuable?

669
30:07.480 --> 30:08.160
The president means...

670
30:08.160 --> 30:09.420
We need him to be loyal.

671
30:09.880 --> 30:11.410
Loyal? Who? The president?

672
30:14.780 --> 30:16.820
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

673
30:19.000 --> 30:19.790
Jiao.

674
30:22.030 --> 30:22.680
Come on.

675
30:23.030 --> 30:24.930
Let me examine you.

676
30:25.590 --> 30:26.790
Squeeze my hand.

677
30:32.880 --> 30:33.680
Harder.

678
30:35.350 --> 30:36.160
Very good.

679
30:36.680 --> 30:37.510
Slowly.

680
30:38.750 --> 30:40.440
Now the other hand. Here.

681
30:42.270 --> 30:43.070
Squeeze.

682
30:46.350 --> 30:47.240
Well done.

683
30:49.550 --> 30:51.350
Any problems with the feeding tube?

684
30:51.350 --> 30:52.480
No problems with it.

685
30:52.790 --> 30:54.440
Talk to her more often

686
30:55.160 --> 30:57.360
to help her regain her ability to speak.

687
30:58.160 --> 31:00.220
Physical therapy is important, too.

688
31:01.070 --> 31:03.330
It can reduce the risk of complications.

689
31:03.880 --> 31:05.270
When you have time,

690
31:05.480 --> 31:06.200
you can take her out

691
31:06.200 --> 31:08.260
in her wheelchair for some fresh air,

692
31:08.680 --> 31:10.160
but not for too long.

693
31:10.160 --> 31:10.880
Okay.

694
31:11.400 --> 31:13.400
Jiao is making a very good recovery.

695
31:13.720 --> 31:14.440
If you have any

696
31:14.440 --> 31:15.550
further questions,

697
31:15.550 --> 31:17.160
you can speak to Dr. Che.

698
31:18.960 --> 31:19.720
Dr. Liu.

699
31:21.270 --> 31:22.070
Well,

700
31:22.510 --> 31:23.840
I heard you're leaving.

701
31:25.270 --> 31:26.470
It's a work transfer.

702
31:27.110 --> 31:28.880
I, Zhang Dexu, am not good with words.

703
31:28.880 --> 31:30.310
How about I treat you to a meal?

704
31:30.310 --> 31:31.110
Please don't.

705
31:31.440 --> 31:33.240
I'm allergic to people

706
31:33.310 --> 31:34.240
buying me meals.

707
31:50.590 --> 31:52.520
Are you actually going to cure me or not?

708
31:52.520 --> 31:53.640
One minute you're checking this,

709
31:53.640 --> 31:54.590
the next you're checking something else.

710
31:54.590 --> 31:55.880
It never ends!

711
31:57.160 --> 31:58.490
I want to be discharged.

712
31:59.550 --> 32:01.550
We're doing thorough tests for you.

713
32:02.590 --> 32:04.070
Didn't you say you wanted to see

714
32:04.070 --> 32:05.480
if we could cure you?

715
32:05.480 --> 32:06.720
Then you have to give us some time.

716
32:06.720 --> 32:07.640
Why are you trying to leave again?

717
32:07.640 --> 32:09.240
Why are you throwing my own words

718
32:09.240 --> 32:10.310
back at me?

719
32:10.760 --> 32:12.320
I don't have time for that.

720
32:12.880 --> 32:13.590
Just now,

721
32:13.590 --> 32:15.880
I read my own fortune.

722
32:16.590 --> 32:18.480
It says a windfall is coming to my family.

723
32:18.480 --> 32:19.310
So

724
32:19.440 --> 32:21.040
I need to get back right away.

725
32:21.310 --> 32:22.350
Dad, if fortune-telling actually worked,

726
32:22.350 --> 32:23.950
we'd have been rich ages ago.

727
32:24.000 --> 32:24.960
Even if you get rich,

728
32:24.960 --> 32:26.890
isn't your health more important?

729
32:27.830 --> 32:29.160
Money can buy you good health.

730
32:29.160 --> 32:30.640
Look at all those rich people,

731
32:30.640 --> 32:31.550
the millionaires.

732
32:31.550 --> 32:32.200
Every one of them

733
32:32.200 --> 32:33.790
seems to live longer than everyone else.

734
32:33.790 --> 32:35.510
Isn't that because they're rich?

735
32:35.510 --> 32:37.440
So you do believe in medicine.

736
32:37.960 --> 32:39.550
You just don't believe in us.

737
32:39.550 --> 32:40.310
Right!

738
32:40.480 --> 32:42.480
Before I came here, I believed in you.

739
32:42.480 --> 32:43.400
But since I got here,

740
32:43.400 --> 32:44.160
it's been one test after another,

741
32:44.160 --> 32:45.000
day after day,

742
32:45.000 --> 32:46.720
and you still haven't made a diagnosis.

743
32:46.720 --> 32:48.680
How am I supposed to trust you?

744
32:49.410 --> 32:50.310
Dad, they still need to run

745
32:50.310 --> 32:51.550
a few more tests.

746
32:51.830 --> 32:53.560
What's the point of doing that?

747
32:53.720 --> 32:55.310
Life and death are in the hands of fate; wealth and honor are in the hands of God.

748
32:55.310 --> 32:57.070
Let's go home.

749
32:57.680 --> 32:58.680
No, Mr. Wang.

750
32:58.680 --> 33:00.550
-How about you read my fortune? -Hey, Mr. Wang.

751
33:00.550 --> 33:01.400
How about you read my fortune?

752
33:01.400 --> 33:02.030
Slow down. Slow down.

753
33:02.030 --> 33:03.310
-What can I do if I don't become a doctor? -Listen to me.

754
33:02.680 --> 33:05.990
[Building a clean and honest medical environment]

755
33:03.310 --> 33:03.750
Mr. Wang!

756
33:03.750 --> 33:05.030
Listen... listen to me,

757
33:05.030 --> 33:05.830
if you leave,

758
33:05.830 --> 33:06.920
you will be in great danger.

759
33:06.020 --> 33:11.570
[Code of Conduct for Xiaoximen Hospital's Medical Staff]

760
33:06.920 --> 33:08.110
If your condition progresses,

761
33:08.110 --> 33:09.160
it could get really bad.

762
33:09.160 --> 33:09.720
How about this?

763
33:09.720 --> 33:10.680
If you don't trust us,

764
33:10.680 --> 33:11.960
I'll contact No. 1 Hospital for you.

765
33:11.960 --> 33:12.960
Once I know you've been admitted there,

766
33:12.960 --> 33:14.560
then I'll let you leave here.

767
33:14.880 --> 33:16.030
Is this a hospital

768
33:16.640 --> 33:18.030
or a bandits' hideout?

769
33:18.270 --> 33:20.000
Why can't I just leave?

770
33:20.000 --> 33:20.510
That's not what I meant.

771
33:20.510 --> 33:21.110
Mr. Wang.

772
33:21.110 --> 33:21.960
Don't pull me!

773
33:22.750 --> 33:23.550
President.

774
33:26.350 --> 33:27.410
Do you remember me?

775
33:28.070 --> 33:29.600
You look a little familiar.

776
33:29.680 --> 33:32.480
We played chess at the park by the railway station.

777
33:32.640 --> 33:34.440
That's why you seemed familiar.

778
33:36.160 --> 33:37.030
Bro.

779
33:38.030 --> 33:39.310
I've learned a little

780
33:39.510 --> 33:41.240
about your condition.

781
33:41.920 --> 33:43.580
It is indeed hard to diagnose.

782
33:44.510 --> 33:46.270
Medical science today

783
33:46.270 --> 33:47.400
is not omnipotent,

784
33:47.400 --> 33:48.160
you know?

785
33:49.590 --> 33:50.790
See? That's more like it.

786
33:50.790 --> 33:52.050
It's pleasant to hear.

787
33:52.310 --> 33:53.570
That's our President.

788
33:55.480 --> 33:56.680
You're pretty impressive yourself.

789
33:56.680 --> 33:57.480
You seem like

790
33:57.480 --> 33:59.340
a well-read, knowledgeable man.

791
33:59.550 --> 34:01.070
If your daughter hadn't brought you here,

792
34:01.070 --> 34:02.270
you'd probably have tried a few

793
34:02.270 --> 34:03.960
folk remedies at home, right?

794
34:04.240 --> 34:04.960
Right.

795
34:05.310 --> 34:05.880
Bro,

796
34:05.880 --> 34:07.070
I'm not bragging.

797
34:07.310 --> 34:10.110
I have a complete guide to folk remedies,

798
34:10.110 --> 34:11.630
and it's actually handwritten.

799
34:11.630 --> 34:13.760
That's been passed down in the Wang family

800
34:13.760 --> 34:15.960
generation after generation.

801
34:16.070 --> 34:17.280
If we can figure it out,

802
34:17.280 --> 34:19.920
we could treat illnesses just as well as they do.

803
34:19.920 --> 34:21.320
You're quite something.

804
34:22.360 --> 34:24.360
Then I'll cut straight to the chase.

805
34:25.150 --> 34:26.280
Think carefully.

806
34:27.960 --> 34:28.800
Have you used

807
34:28.800 --> 34:29.670
any folk remedies

808
34:29.670 --> 34:30.880
on yourself?

809
34:32.960 --> 34:33.960
Yes.

810
34:35.030 --> 34:35.840
Right.

811
34:35.840 --> 34:37.920
I had scabies a while ago,

812
34:38.670 --> 34:39.360
so I bought

813
34:39.360 --> 34:40.670
a pig's tail.

814
34:40.670 --> 34:42.110
I ate half of it raw

815
34:42.110 --> 34:42.880
and put the other half

816
34:42.880 --> 34:44.550
on the wounds.

817
34:45.360 --> 34:47.000
A few days later,

818
34:47.550 --> 34:48.880
the scabies cleared up.

819
34:49.320 --> 34:50.580
Parasitic infection!

820
34:50.880 --> 34:52.610
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

821
34:53.400 --> 34:54.860
I'll leave the rest to you.

822
34:54.880 --> 34:57.070
I'll arrange the corresponding tests immediately.

823
34:57.070 --> 34:58.200
Hold on, more tests?

824
34:58.320 --> 34:59.760
What's the point of this?

825
34:59.760 --> 35:00.630
One test

826
35:00.630 --> 35:01.070
after another.

827
35:01.070 --> 35:03.400
-This is never going to end, is it? -No, this time is different.

828
35:03.400 --> 35:04.860
-Wang! Wang! -Infection!

829
35:04.920 --> 35:05.710
Listen to me.

830
35:05.840 --> 35:07.700
Let's have a quick word over here.

831
35:13.340 --> 35:18.870
[Priority for Stroke Patients] [Chest Pain is Preferenced]

832
35:19.320 --> 35:20.070
Sure, bro.

833
35:24.550 --> 35:26.080
President Long called me over.

834
35:26.080 --> 35:27.890
I completely agree now.

835
35:28.880 --> 35:30.480
Run whatever tests you want.

836
35:30.840 --> 35:31.550
All right?

837
35:31.550 --> 35:32.680
-Okay, okay. -Good.

838
35:38.140 --> 35:40.750
[Fujian Kangtaierke Hospital Invitation Letter]

839
35:39.280 --> 35:41.810
This is a privately owned hospital in Fujian.

840
35:42.480 --> 35:44.410
President Hong is a friend of mine.

841
35:45.510 --> 35:47.550
I've sent him your profile,

842
35:47.880 --> 35:49.670
and he's very interested in you.

843
35:49.670 --> 35:51.920
So he sent these introduction brochures

844
35:51.920 --> 35:54.050
and invited you to visit the hospital.

845
35:54.320 --> 35:55.580
If you're interested,

846
35:56.030 --> 35:57.030
go check it out

847
35:57.680 --> 35:59.210
and see what he has to offer.

848
36:00.110 --> 36:01.590
It might be a good option.

849
36:03.960 --> 36:04.590
Okay.

850
36:13.360 --> 36:15.150
This is a personal connection

851
36:15.150 --> 36:16.810
I've been building for years.

852
36:18.110 --> 36:20.310
I've never called in this favor before.

853
36:20.320 --> 36:21.670
This is the first time.

854
36:25.800 --> 36:27.070
Don't feel pressured.

855
36:27.590 --> 36:30.230
Don't feel like you owe me a big favor.

856
36:31.710 --> 36:33.150
I-I won't.

857
36:39.030 --> 36:40.630
I've always seen it as my duty

858
36:41.590 --> 36:43.840
to help younger colleagues get ahead.

859
36:46.000 --> 36:46.760
Solving problems

860
36:46.760 --> 36:48.760
for your younger brother's surgery

861
36:49.630 --> 36:51.690
and giving you a promotion and a raise

862
36:52.280 --> 36:54.680
were all because I appreciate your talent.

863
36:55.150 --> 36:55.960
I know.

864
36:57.670 --> 36:59.030
When you leave,

865
37:00.110 --> 37:01.280
if anyone dares to call you

866
37:01.280 --> 37:02.190
ungrateful,

867
37:02.190 --> 37:03.320
you must let me know.

868
37:03.630 --> 37:05.510
I'll beat the heck out of them.

869
37:06.550 --> 37:07.950
There's no need for that.

870
37:08.070 --> 37:08.960
Anyway, I'm not planning to come back

871
37:08.960 --> 37:10.220
once I leave this time.

872
37:10.440 --> 37:11.510
I don't care

873
37:11.880 --> 37:12.840
what they say.

874
37:22.400 --> 37:23.840
It's a shame, really.

875
37:24.320 --> 37:25.590
If you could stay,

876
37:25.590 --> 37:26.710
in three years, you could be in

877
37:26.710 --> 37:28.000
Chief Physician Tong's position,

878
37:28.000 --> 37:29.510
and take over from me by the age of 40.

879
37:29.510 --> 37:30.710
How did you know that?

880
37:33.960 --> 37:35.070
That patient's case

881
37:35.070 --> 37:36.280
is quite unusual.

882
37:36.920 --> 37:37.840
How did you know

883
37:37.840 --> 37:39.300
he had tried a folk remedy?

884
37:43.070 --> 37:44.200
Do you want to learn?

885
37:45.590 --> 37:46.920
Stay and I'll teach you.

886
37:50.030 --> 37:52.230
I'll go arrange the patient's surgery.

887
38:01.760 --> 38:03.320
What's your name, sir?

888
38:04.230 --> 38:05.550
Wang Zongqi.

889
38:05.630 --> 38:07.690
We're about to put you under general anesthesia.

890
38:07.690 --> 38:08.940
Take a deep breath.

891
38:09.400 --> 38:10.360
Breathe in.

892
38:11.190 --> 38:12.110
Breathe in.

893
38:12.880 --> 38:14.280
Take a deep breath again.

894
38:20.070 --> 38:21.480
Tell me, how did the president

895
38:21.480 --> 38:23.210
know he had tried a folk remedy?

896
38:26.440 --> 38:27.480
How would I know?

897
38:27.840 --> 38:28.710
You've followed him for so long,

898
38:28.710 --> 38:30.110
and you still don't know?

899
38:31.230 --> 38:33.000
Long really knows his stuff.

900
38:35.510 --> 38:36.440
Do you think

901
38:36.440 --> 38:38.030
he actually knows this patient?

902
38:38.030 --> 38:39.630
How about I ask the anesthesiologist to wake him up,

903
38:39.630 --> 38:40.760
so you can ask him yourself?

904
38:40.760 --> 38:41.560
What's wrong?

905
38:41.840 --> 38:43.100
None of your business.

906
38:44.760 --> 38:45.840
Have you noticed

907
38:46.070 --> 38:47.130
the way you talk now

908
38:47.510 --> 38:49.230
is getting more and more northeastern?

909
38:49.230 --> 38:50.030
No, I'm not.

910
38:50.030 --> 38:51.230
Don't make things up.

911
38:51.670 --> 38:52.630
Chief Physician Liu is

912
38:52.630 --> 38:54.160
getting funnier by the day.

913
38:54.480 --> 38:56.010
I'm not funny. Give me that.

914
38:58.110 --> 38:59.230
What are you laughing at?

915
38:59.230 --> 39:00.190
Nothing, nothing.

916
39:00.190 --> 39:01.630
You're not funny at all.

917
39:01.960 --> 39:03.690
Round needle, size one suture.

918
39:04.000 --> 39:05.630
All right, focus.

919
39:05.880 --> 39:06.880
We're operating.

920
39:12.510 --> 39:14.710
Your technique is getting steadier.

921
39:14.840 --> 39:15.480
Scissors.

922
39:15.760 --> 39:17.890
That's because I have a great teacher.

923
39:18.190 --> 39:18.670
At the very least,

924
39:18.670 --> 39:20.130
we need to get in sync here.

925
39:20.160 --> 39:21.840
But this is Chief Physician Liu's

926
39:21.840 --> 39:23.500
last surgery at our hospital.

927
39:34.440 --> 39:35.800
Family of Wang Zongqi?

928
39:41.190 --> 39:42.650
The surgery was a success.

929
39:42.670 --> 39:43.760
This is what we removed

930
39:43.760 --> 39:44.440
from your father's head.

931
39:44.440 --> 39:45.250
Take a look.

932
39:49.030 --> 39:50.440
He's out of danger.

933
39:53.880 --> 39:55.320
Hello, Dr. Liu.

934
39:54.580 --> 39:57.690
[No smoking]

935
39:57.550 --> 39:58.680
Were you calling me?

936
39:58.760 --> 40:00.360
Yes, I was calling you.

937
40:00.360 --> 40:01.110
Come here.

938
40:01.670 --> 40:02.480
Sit with me for a while.

939
40:02.480 --> 40:03.340
Sit for a while.

940
40:04.110 --> 40:05.440
I don't think I know you.

941
40:06.360 --> 40:07.590
You don't know me,

942
40:07.710 --> 40:08.800
but I know you.

943
40:11.440 --> 40:12.230
That's true.

944
40:12.760 --> 40:14.820
With my big photo hanging on the wall,

945
40:15.030 --> 40:16.830
who around here doesn't know me?

946
40:17.150 --> 40:18.510
Yes, that's right.

947
40:18.800 --> 40:19.670
Dr. Liu,

948
40:21.000 --> 40:21.800
you know what?

949
40:22.070 --> 40:23.360
You strike me

950
40:24.070 --> 40:26.000
as a broken person.

951
40:26.480 --> 40:28.150
And then you were

952
40:28.230 --> 40:29.550
pieced back together,

953
40:29.550 --> 40:31.590
then covered with a layer of glue,

954
40:31.590 --> 40:33.630
forming a kind of shell.

955
40:34.280 --> 40:35.400
The last person

956
40:35.400 --> 40:36.800
who gave me that impression

957
40:36.800 --> 40:38.480
was President Long.

958
40:43.110 --> 40:44.840
[Liu Zhengliang]

959
40:43.630 --> 40:45.360
Do you know Long Dongdong well?

960
40:45.710 --> 40:46.920
I've been working at Xiaoximen Hospital

961
40:46.920 --> 40:48.280
for 35 years.

962
40:48.280 --> 40:49.880
Trust me, I know everybody.

963
40:52.920 --> 40:53.710
Dr. Liu...

964
40:54.450 --> 40:55.070
Dr. Liu?

965
40:55.070 --> 40:56.150
Don't you want to know how Long Dongdong

966
40:56.150 --> 40:57.380
figured out that your patient

967
40:57.380 --> 40:58.500
used a folk remedy?

968
41:01.390 --> 41:03.690
[Doctor White coat Place]

969
41:02.590 --> 41:03.840
How did you know about that?

970
41:03.840 --> 41:04.920
First, tell me

971
41:04.920 --> 41:06.320
if you want to know or not.

972
41:06.350 --> 41:08.530
[Doctor's White Coat Hooks]

973
41:07.400 --> 41:08.070
Yes.

974
41:11.440 --> 41:12.440
Here's the thing.

975
41:13.030 --> 41:13.800
You see,

976
41:13.920 --> 41:14.550
you work at

977
41:14.550 --> 41:16.360
a big hospital in the South.

978
41:16.880 --> 41:18.760
Your patients

979
41:18.760 --> 41:19.710
all come from

980
41:19.710 --> 41:20.920
your region

981
41:20.920 --> 41:22.840
and the surrounding area;

982
41:23.000 --> 41:25.510
those are the people who come to you for treatment.

983
41:25.510 --> 41:27.360
But the people

984
41:27.480 --> 41:28.320
Xiaoximen Hospital serves

985
41:28.320 --> 41:29.880
are... are different.

986
41:29.880 --> 41:31.630
It faces...

987
41:32.960 --> 41:34.110
I mean, it...

988
41:35.550 --> 41:37.030
it caters to...

989
41:39.710 --> 41:40.630
I-it...

990
41:41.590 --> 41:43.190
it serves...

991
41:43.510 --> 41:44.440
well...

992
41:45.400 --> 41:46.190
it serves...

993
41:47.620 --> 41:55.750
[Buffer Room to Staff Quarters]

994
41:49.550 --> 41:50.320
Wait, wait, wait.

995
41:50.320 --> 41:52.360
Your handwriting is too small.

996
41:52.880 --> 41:53.940
Can you make it out?

997
41:54.070 --> 41:54.670
Well, um...

998
41:54.670 --> 41:55.550
Hold on, where were you?

999
41:55.550 --> 41:56.280
Let me see.

1000
41:56.590 --> 41:57.400
Here.

1001
41:57.670 --> 41:58.800
It serves patients

1002
41:58.800 --> 41:59.840
from the local area.

1003
41:59.840 --> 42:01.000
That's the line, right?

1004
42:01.000 --> 42:02.920
The patient base is very stable.

1005
42:02.920 --> 42:04.030
No, you...

1006
42:04.030 --> 42:05.550
It's a group of people who don't have access

1007
42:05.550 --> 42:07.360
to quality medical resources.

1008
42:07.550 --> 42:10.360
Long Dongdong has a deep understanding of this issue.

1009
42:10.360 --> 42:13.110
For years, he's running around to serve the public.

1010
42:13.110 --> 42:14.280
Every Wednesday and Friday,

1011
42:14.280 --> 42:16.230
he holds free clinics in the community

1012
42:16.230 --> 42:17.630
without charging a cent.

1013
42:17.640 --> 42:19.360
That's why he understands what patients

1014
42:19.360 --> 42:21.190
like Wang Zongqi are thinking.

1015
42:21.570 --> 42:23.230
He's a doctor who isn't driven

1016
42:23.280 --> 42:24.920
by fame or money.

1017
42:25.880 --> 42:27.810
He's a role model worth following.

1018
42:30.000 --> 42:31.960
That's a pretty good press release.

1019
42:31.960 --> 42:33.000
Well, about this...

1020
42:33.000 --> 42:34.190
I didn't write it.

1021
42:34.190 --> 42:35.550
But it's all true.

1022
42:37.800 --> 42:38.600
I believe you.

1023
42:39.550 --> 42:41.360
Thanks for clearing that up for me.

1024
42:41.360 --> 42:42.190
No, wait...

1025
42:42.190 --> 42:43.320
I mean, Dr. Liu...

1026
42:43.630 --> 42:44.960
Dr. Liu?

1027
42:48.550 --> 42:49.750
Finished washing up?

1028
42:57.400 --> 42:58.280
Jiang!

1029
42:58.280 --> 42:59.070
How could you drop the ball

1030
42:59.070 --> 42:59.920
at such a crucial moment?

1031
42:59.920 --> 43:01.880
What do you mean, I dropped the ball?

1032
43:01.880 --> 43:02.880
What the heck did you write?

1033
43:02.880 --> 43:03.230
It's so hard!

1034
43:03.230 --> 43:04.400
H-how am I supposed to memorize all this?

1035
43:04.400 --> 43:05.000
Is it hard?

1036
43:05.000 --> 43:06.320
You can't even memorize these few words?

1037
43:06.320 --> 43:07.030
You're useless at everything!

1038
43:07.030 --> 43:08.030
You never do anything right!

1039
43:08.030 --> 43:09.190
You're good for nothing!

1040
43:09.190 --> 43:10.920
You're the one who's good for nothing!

1041
43:10.920 --> 43:11.920
It's only a few words?

1042
43:11.920 --> 43:13.510
Are you messing with me or what?
